=== ttttNeverReducedHasNeverType.ts ===
// An intersection whose property conflicts between two constituents (`{}` and the optional never's `undefined`) isn't
// reduced when a third constituent's is never (tsc's CheckFlags.HasNeverType): apollo-client's options with
